      "id": "f-mem-scope-fe5f46",
      "name": "FMemScope",
      "category": "TagTrace",
      "signature": "FMemScope()",
      "params": [],
      "returnType": "public :",
      "docs": "Used to associate any allocation within this scope to a given tag.\nWe need to be able to convert the three types of inputs to LLM scopes:\n- ELLMTag, an uint8 with fixed categories. There are three sub ranges\nGeneric tags, platform and project tags.\n- FName, free form string, for example a specific asset.\n- TagData, an opaque pointer from LLM."
    },
